      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Bicep + gated CI/CD + federated identity | same tested artifact | lower staging capacity, same controls | recovery targets + restore drills\n* Activity API remains Preview even with GA Cosmos. Validate fresh SSO, two-user isolation, concurrent turns and financial accuracy.\nCosmos DB persistence does not add durable execution. No queue / workflow service is assumed. Private networking needs end-to-end validation.",
      "originalText": "Bicep + gated CI/CD + federated identity | same tested artifact | lower staging capacity, same controls | recovery targets + restore drills\n* Activity API remains Preview even with GA Cosmos. Validate fresh SSO, two-user isolation, concurrent turns and financial accuracy.\nCosmos DB persistence does not add durable execution. No queue / workflow service is assumed. Private networking needs end-to-end validation.",
